rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.lmsw}
attack: clts
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.clts}
attack: ltr
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.ltr_f}
attack: lldt
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.lldt_f}
attack: kernel data
rx286: program fault #GP(0010) at 0043:{attacks.kdata_f}
attack: kernel stack
rx286: program fault #GP(0018) at 0043:{attacks.kstack_f}
