rx286: program fault #GP(0008) at 0043:{attacks.kcall}
attack: jump to the TSS
rx286: program fault #GP(0020) at 0043:{attacks.tss}
attack: call the double-fault TSS
rx286: program fault #GP(0028) at 0043:{attacks.dftss}
attack: int 31h
rx286: program fault #GP(018A) at 0043:{attacks.int31}
attack: int 21h
rx286: program fault #GP(010A) at 0043:{attacks.int21}
attack: int 3
rx286: program fault #GP(001A) at 0043:{attacks.int3}
attack: into
rx286: program fault #GP(0022) at 0043:{attacks.into_f}
attack: write code
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.wcode}
attack: past the limit
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.limit}
attack: a word across the limit
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.word}
