rx286: program fault #SS(0000) at 0043:{attacks.stack_f}
attack: execute data
rx286: program fault #GP(0048) at 0043:{attacks.exec}
attack: divide by zero
rx286: program fault #DE at 0043:{attacks.div_f}
attack: invalid opcode
rx286: program fault #UD at 0043:{attacks.ud}
attack: bound
rx286: program fault #BR at 0043:{attacks.bound_f}
attack: trap flag
rx286: program fault #DB at 0043:{attacks.tf_after}
attack: NT and iret
rx286: program fault #TS(0000) at 0043:{attacks.nt_f}
attack: IOPL through popf
rx286: program fault #GP(0000) at 0043:{attacks.iopl_f}
attack: lock
attack: lock ran without a fault (not a 286)
attack: loadall
rx286: program fault #UD at 0043:{attacks.loadall}
attack: 287 error
rx286: the 287 reported an error (IRQ13)
attack: write past the limit
attack: refused, error 1
